### 对话
POST http://localhost:8000/router/chat/stream
Content-Type: application/json
Connection: keep-alive
user-token: user_123
# 通过 /message/chat/create 创建获得，同一轮对话里面保持相同的 chat-id
chat-id: chat_758d050e-7b3d-46a9-a994-1385fe38d884

{
  "content": "你好啊"
}

### 访问 writing agent
POST http://localhost:8000/router/chat/stream
Content-Type: application/json
Connection: keep-alive
user-token: user_123
chat-id: chat_76d54f0e-759f-4142-af32-c36b3e32c202

{
  "content": "@writing 写一首关于 Agent 的诗，要求 20 字以内",
  "agents": [
    // 指定 agent 和对应的任务
    {"name": "writing", "query": "写一首关于 Agent 的诗，要求 20 字以内"}
  ]
}
